 udisks2, util-linux
Recommends: gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-secret-1, libnotify-bin
Description: copy and sync folders between local disks and external drives
 LinFileCopy is a GTK dashboard for rsync-based copy, mirror and two-way sync
 jobs between internal disks, removable drives and local storage arrays. It
 previews changes, adapts to each drive's filesystem, keeps hard-linked
 snapshots, unlocks encrypted drives, runs jobs on a schedule or when a drive
 is plugged in, and keeps a searchable history with logs.
